john
Usage: john --format=TYPE --wordlist=LIST HASHES   then: john --show HASHES

Offline password cracker: given a file of password hashes, it tries words from
a list (and rules) against them, fast, on the cpu. Offline means no target sees
it -- but you still need the hashes lawfully.

	--wordlist=LIST      the words to try ( rockyou.txt is the classic )
	--format=TYPE        the hash type, e.g. `raw-md5`, `nt`
	--show               print the passwords already cracked
	(bare) john HASHES   auto-detect the format and start

Crack only hashes you are authorised to hold.

See also: hydra, minisign
